! Polar questions with 吗 (ma)

Attach sentence-final 吗 (ma, neutral tone) to a declarative proposition to ask a yes/no question.

* 你学中文。 — Nǐ xué Zhōngwén. — You study Chinese.
* 你学中文吗？ — Nǐ xué Zhōngwén ma? — Do you study Chinese?
* 他是弟子吗？ — Tā shì dìzǐ ma? — Is he a disciple?

Mandarin also has A-not-A questions and other interrogative patterns, which we will add later.

